WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.460
- So, your baking show Nailed It!,

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:02.930
it was nominated for an Emmy, right?

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:03.923
- Yes, yes, yes!

00:00:03.923 --> 00:00:04.948
(applause)

00:00:04.948 --> 00:00:06.370
Thank you.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:07.670
Thank you.

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:08.660
We did lose.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.590
We lost to RuPaul's Drag Race,

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:12.390
which I get it, it's my favorite show.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.290
I truly love it.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.123
- It's hilarious.

00:00:14.123 --> 00:00:14.956
- [Nicole] It's so good.

00:00:14.956 --> 00:00:16.460
