00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:17.800
Have you ever been to the Emmys before?

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.750
- No, I've never been to the Emmys.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.460
- Yeah, I've only been
once and I felt like

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.617
which one of these is not like the other?

00:00:22.617 --> 00:00:23.450
- [Nicole] Only one time?

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:25.347
- Why the hell would I be at the Emmys?

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.880
- Because you're all of our American idol.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.713
- Well, no, I just mean like

00:00:29.713 --> 00:00:30.970
I mean, now I have a TV show,

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.707
but before you know, singers
don't generally show up.

00:00:32.707 --> 00:00:34.190
- Oh, I guess so.

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:35.410
Well, it was my first Emmys.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.720
It was very glamorous.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.553
I loved it.

00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:40.500
There was just famous
people very close to you

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.960
which is like a real delight.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:42.793
- Yeah.

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:44.050
Well, when they're a delight.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.440
- Well yes, but they're all

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:46.870
well, they're walking
around with publicists

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:47.703
so they can't have,

00:00:47.703 --> 00:00:49.030
they don't have time to be mean, you know.

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:49.898
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:49.898 --> 00:00:54.217
- I saw Viola Davis
and I love Viola Davis.

00:00:54.217 --> 00:00:55.050
- Me too.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:56.490
