00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.016
don't do it, so

00:01:00.016 --> 00:01:01.610
(laughing)

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:02.560
I didn't do it,

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.530
but then at the Emmys I was
like this is a work event,

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.093
I can talk to whoever I want.

00:01:06.093 --> 00:01:06.926
(laughing)

00:01:06.926 --> 00:01:07.759
- [Kelly] It is a work event.

00:01:07.759 --> 00:01:09.260
- I just picture two
people on your shoulders

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:10.355
