00:01:10.355 --> 00:01:11.240
(laughing)

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:12.240
- Good cop, bad cop.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:16.103
- So, I went up to her and I
was like I am bothering you,

00:01:16.103 --> 00:01:18.950
but I need you to know I love you.

00:01:18.950 --> 00:01:20.900
And she truly was like
half eating a hamburger

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:23.543
